.TH SDL_WINAPI_FAMILY_PHONE 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_WINAPI_FAMILY_PHONE \- A preprocessor macro that defined to 1 if compiling for Windows Phone.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_platform_defines.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_WINAPI_FAMILY_PHONE (WINAPI_FAMILY == WINAPI_FAMILY_PHONE_APP)
.fi
